# "Other Cats you control" (CR 603.2): Bot2 casts its own Ajani on turn 4 and Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Cat Warrior on turn 5.
# Bot1's Ajani does not trigger (the Cat is not Bot1's), so exactly one trigger (Bot2's) is on the stack once the Bolt resolves and Bot1 is never asked; Bot2's Ajani
# does (the Cat is Bot2's, the positive control that the trigger works), and Bot2 declines the "you may": its Ajani stays
# on the battlefield untransformed.

